# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Silent-Video-Project — what NOT to publish
#
# The working tree is ~28 GB. Almost all of that is virtual environments and
# model weights, which are reproducible from the setup docs and must not be
# redistributed. This repository carries SOURCE, DOCUMENTATION, and small
# DEMO MEDIA only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
._*
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# --- local tool settings ---
.claude/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- virtual environments (never commit; recreate from docs) ---
venv*/
**/venv*/
.venv/
env/

# --- Node ---
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/frontend/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*

# --- model weights & checkpoints (licence + size) -------------------------
# MOSS-SoundEffect v2.0 ....... 10 GB, download per moss install docs
# MMAudio / AudioLDM2 ......... evaluated then rejected
# Stable Audio Open 1.0 ....... Stability AI Community licence, NON-COMMERCIAL,
#                               redistribution not permitted here
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.onnx
Module3_Fresh/moss/checkpoints/
Module3_Fresh/models/
Module3_Fresh/work/

# --- vendored third-party repository ---------------------------------------
# MOSS-TTS is pinned at upstream commit 58b20a0 and is deliberately NOT
# vendored here: it must stay pristine. Clone it per Module3_Fresh/docs.
Module3_Fresh/moss/MOSS-TTS/

# --- runtime data (per-run uploads, jobs and outputs) ---
Module3_Fresh/data/

# --- separate earlier projects, not part of action recognition ---
01-Lip-Reading/
02-Auto-AVSR-Test/

# --- 03-FoleyCrafter-Test: keep only the Module 2 source + evaluation record
03-FoleyCrafter-Test/**
!03-FoleyCrafter-Test/
!03-FoleyCrafter-Test/*.py
!03-FoleyCrafter-Test/action-recognition/
!03-FoleyCrafter-Test/action-recognition/*.py
!03-FoleyCrafter-Test/action-recognition/results/
!03-FoleyCrafter-Test/action-recognition/results/*.json
!03-FoleyCrafter-Test/action-recognition/results/*.txt
!03-FoleyCrafter-Test/action-recognition/results/*.md
!03-FoleyCrafter-Test/action-recognition/qwen/
!03-FoleyCrafter-Test/action-recognition/qwen/*.py
!03-FoleyCrafter-Test/action-recognition/videomae/
!03-FoleyCrafter-Test/action-recognition/videomae/*.py

# --- logs ---
*.log
